    "## 5. Load every `He <number>.txt` file into a dict of DataFrames\n",
    "\n",
    "We restrict the file glob to the `He <number>.txt` naming convention used for proper BCA / PBCA / experimental measurements; any other `.txt` files in the tree are ignored. PBCAs (5 intensity columns) are caught and tracked in `pbca_skipped` separately from genuine parse errors. The resulting `dataframes` dict is keyed by `\"<subdir>/<filename_without_extension>\"` so files from different subdirectories never collide."
   ]
